WEBVTT

00:08:28.076 --> 00:08:34.316
It’s always women, women of color,
and we don’t get paid for that.

00:08:34.356 --> 00:08:36.396
That's not part of our performance review,

00:08:36.396 --> 00:08:38.476
that's not part of our
compensation package.

00:08:38.476 --> 00:08:39.636
But we do it.

00:08:39.676 --> 00:08:40.836
And quite frankly,

00:08:40.876 --> 00:08:42.636
when we don't do it, we're penalized.

00:08:42.636 --> 00:08:46.236
I'll never forget, I was talking
to a bunch of CIA agents, CIA agents,

00:08:46.236 --> 00:08:48.156
and one of them had just had a baby.

00:08:48.196 --> 00:08:49.756
And she said, "You know, Reshma,

00:08:49.756 --> 00:08:53.716
that year, I did not organize
the office Christmas party.

00:08:54.236 --> 00:08:57.076
And that was also the year
that I -- it was the only year --

00:08:57.116 --> 00:08:58.396
I didn't get promoted.

00:08:58.836 --> 00:09:00.196
And I can't prove it,